; ADVAPI32.DEF
;
; The functions the Windows 98 SE / Me build may import from ADVAPI32.dll:
; the import library is made from this list (llvm-dlltool -k), and
; tools/win9x_check.py fails a linked image that imports anything else.
;
; Each name here is exported and implemented by the ADVAPI32 of Windows 98
; Second Edition and of Windows Me: the registry, ANSI versions only. The
; CryptoAPI (CryptAcquireContextA, CryptGenRandom) is looked up at run time:
; Windows 95 before OSR2 lacks it.

LIBRARY ADVAPI32.dll
EXPORTS
RegCloseKey@4
RegCreateKeyExA@36
RegDeleteKeyA@8
RegDeleteValueA@8
RegOpenKeyExA@20
RegQueryValueExA@24
RegSetValueExA@24
